      "text": "TECHNIQUE         VISCOSITY RANGE       SCALE        TYPICAL PRODUCT\n——————————        ———————————           —————        ———————————————\nFree blowing      10³-10⁵ Pa·s          Studio        Art glass, vessels\nMold blowing      10³-10⁵              Craft/indust.  Bottles, shaped vessels\nIS machine        10³-10⁴              Industrial     100M+ bottles/day globally\nFloat             10³-10⁵              Industrial     Flat glass ribbon\nDrawing           10⁴-10⁶              Industrial     Sheets, tubing, fiber\nPressing          10³-10⁵              Industrial     Tableware, lenses, thick items\nCasting           10²-10⁴              Studio/indust. Sculptural, optical blanks\nFusing/slumping   Below softening       Studio/indust. Bowls, plates, panels\nLampworking       10³-10⁵ (local)      Studio         Beads, scientific ware\nPâte de verre     ~Sintering temp      Studio         Small cast objects\n```"
